<h2>Pay over time</h2>
<p>Jettribe provides financing through Bread so an order can be paid over time. Rates range from 0% to 29.99% APR. For example, 12 monthly payments of $87.91 at 9.99% APR per $1,000 borrowed. APRs vary by credit, amount, and term. Bread pay-over-time plans are loans made by Comenity Capital Bank. Subject to approval.</p>
